  <item>
    <title>186）有点lan：朴树《我去2000年》</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6adf7031c96c8942ec12a323</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6adf7031c96c8942ec12a323</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 26 Oct 2026 15:32:50 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>「小调整后的“熟人局”特辑：1st Half」</span></p><p></p><p><strong><span>欢迎“订阅”“收藏”“分享”，如有意见或建议，希望不吝赐教。</span></strong></p><p></p><p><span>本期边听边聊，回到相对熟悉的“黄金年代”，听一听那个低产但令人“魂牵梦绕”的男人朴树的首张专辑——《我去2000年》。</span></p><p><span>&lt;不管憧憬兴奋也好，踌躇担忧也罢，新的时代总会到来&gt;</span></p><p></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="35">00:00:35</a> 开玩笑开嗓开场</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="157">00:02:37</a> 浅谈朴树的第一张特别之处与小小感悟</span></p><h2><em><span>【向往未来】</span></em></h2><p><em><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="412">00:06:52</a></span></em><em><span> New Boy</span></em></p><p><em><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="900">00:15:00</a></span></em><em><span> 在希望的田野上</span></em></p><p><em><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1395">00:23:15</a></span></em><em><span> 我去2000年</span></em></p><p><em><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1990">00:33:10</a></span></em><em><span> 别，千万别</span></em></p><p><em><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2472">00:41:12</a></span></em><em><span> 活着</span></em></p><p><em><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3060">00:51:00</a></span></em><em><span> &lt;珍藏版BounsTrack&gt;九月</span></em></p><h2><em><span>【彷徨未知】</span></em></h2><p><em><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="645">00:10:45</a></span></em><em><span> 妈妈，我...</span></em></p><p><em><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1098">00:18:18</a></span></em><em><span> 那些花儿 (Oringnal)</span></em></p><p><em><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1720">00:28:40</a></span></em><em><span> 旅途</span></em></p><p><em><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2240">00:37:20</a></span></em><em><span> 白桦林</span></em></p><p><em><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2732">00:45:32</a></span></em><em><span> 召唤</span></em></p><p><em><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3319">00:55:19</a></span></em><em><span> &lt;珍藏版BounsTrack&gt;火车开往冬天</span></em></p><p><em><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3664">01:01:04</a></span></em><em><span> 那些花儿 (Reimagined)</span></em></p><p></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3968">01:06:08</a> 休息…休息一会儿……</span></p><p></p><p><strong><em><span>Instrumental：</span></em></strong></p><p><strong><em><span>朴树 - Radio In My Head</span></em></strong></p><p><strong><em><span>Intro：</span></em></strong></p><p><strong><em><span>コーコーヤ - 昨日・今日・明日</span></em></strong></p><p><strong><em><span>Outro：</span></em></strong></p><p><strong><em><span>TOKIO - NaNaNa(太阳なんていらねぇ) (Backing Track)</span></em></strong></p>]]></description>
