  <item>
    <title>182）有点lan：蛋堡《月光》</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6abbb804195d838e2aeba79a</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6abbb804195d838e2aeba79a</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 29 Sep 2026 13:18:59 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>「“不熟悉”系列Ⅱ：继续走出舒适区，听 亿点点 “陌生”的专辑」</span></p><p></p><p><strong><span>欢迎“订阅”“收藏”“分享”，如有意见或建议，希望不吝赐教。</span></strong></p><p></p><p><span>本期边听边聊，希望能做为抛砖引玉的角色，推荐一张更纯正的Jazz Hip-hop专辑——《月光》。</span></p><p><span>&lt;就不写什么个人想法了，反正听的过程中话也不多：重要的是享受其中&gt;</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="35">00:00:35</a>&nbsp;&nbsp;有些意犹未尽，于是这期继续  </span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="152">00:02:32</a>&nbsp;&nbsp;浅聊一下蛋堡和选这张做入门的原因  </span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="346">00:05:46</a>  We got Jazz  </span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="599">00:09:59</a>&nbsp;&nbsp;经典！  </span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="835">00:13:55</a>&nbsp;&nbsp;I want you  </span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1080">00:18:00</a>&nbsp;&nbsp;钻牙者  </span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1310">00:21:50</a>&nbsp;&nbsp;她和时间跳华尔滋  </span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1690">00:28:10</a>&nbsp;&nbsp;过程  </span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1980">00:33:00</a>&nbsp;&nbsp;月光下  </span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2242">00:37:22</a>&nbsp;&nbsp;夜间漫游  </span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2504">00:41:44</a>&nbsp;&nbsp;经典！(Blu-Swing remix) - remix  </span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2742">00:45:42</a>&nbsp;&nbsp;过程 14？(remix) - remix  </span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3013">00:50:13</a>&nbsp;&nbsp;过程(Shin-Ski`s Still In Progress Remix) - remix  </span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3295">00:54:55</a>&nbsp;&nbsp;安利还算成功：節奏融合 音樂就能說出一切 / 別一來就什麼事都要對我說</span></p><p><br></p><p><strong><span>Instrumental：</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>蛋堡 - 写一首歌 Feat. 方大同  </span></strong></p><p><strong><span>Intro：</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>コーコーヤ - 昨日・今日・明日  </span></strong></p><p><strong><span>Outro：</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>コーコーヤ - 街角Swing&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></strong></p>]]></description>
