    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>「有没有这样一张专辑，当时的你挺喜欢的，可却挺久没有再听过？」</span></p><p></p><p><strong><span>欢迎“订阅”“收藏”“分享”，如有意见或建议，希望不吝赐教。</span></strong></p><p></p><p><em><span>本期边听边聊，来一起听“当年不够识货导致很多后知后觉”的爵味挺足的特别专辑——《原色》。</span></em></p><p><em><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="13">00:00:13</a></span></em><em><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;是是是，对对对：又临时变卦了  </span></em></p><p><em><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="110">00:01:50</a></span></em><em><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;既然提到了就顺带浅聊一下“逃跑计划”吧  </span></em></p><p><em><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="210">00:03:30</a></span></em><em><span>  前摇了那么长时间终于进入正题了</span></em></p><p><em><span>&lt;前半&gt;剖析挖掘  </span></em></p><p><em><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="597">00:09:57</a></span></em><em><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;底细  </span></em></p><p><em><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="916">00:15:16</a></span></em><em><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;怀珠  </span></em></p><p><em><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1183">00:19:43</a></span></em><em><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;光影  </span></em></p><p><em><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1445">00:24:05</a></span></em><em><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;被遗忘的  </span></em></p><p><em><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1732">00:28:52</a></span></em><em><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;馋  </span></em></p><p><em><span>&lt;后半&gt;回顾总结</span></em></p><p><em><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1964">00:32:44</a></span></em><em><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;因为单身的缘故  </span></em></p><p><em><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2217">00:36:57</a></span></em><em><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;前戏  </span></em></p><p><em><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2483">00:41:23</a></span></em><em><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;唱错歌词  </span></em></p><p><em><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2767">00:46:07</a></span></em><em><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;蛮荒情场  </span></em></p><p><em><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3006">00:50:06</a></span></em><em><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;时间神偷  </span></em></p><p><em><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3276">00:54:36</a></span></em><em><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;[Bonus Track]那个男人  </span></em></p><p><em><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3552">00:59:12</a></span></em><em><span>  真诚地呈现作品本来的样子就好</span></em></p><p><br></p><p><strong><em><span>Instrumental：</span></em></strong></p><p><strong><em><span>逃跑计划 - 哪里是你的拥抱  </span></em></strong></p><p><strong><em><span>李宗盛 - 伤心地铁 &amp; 梦醒时分 【“既然青春留不住，还是做个大叔好”演唱会巡回影音纪录】</span></em></strong></p><p><strong><em><span>Intro：</span></em></strong></p><p><strong><em><span>コーコーヤ - 昨日・今日・明日  </span></em></strong></p><p><strong><em><span>Outro：</span></em></strong></p><p><strong><em><span>コーコーヤ - 街角Swing&nbsp; </span></em></strong></p>]]></description>
